{{further|2026 China Open (tennis)}}

[[Amanda Anisimova]] was the reigning champion,<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.france24.com/en/live-news/20251005-us-open-finalist-anisimova-beats-noskova-to-win-beijing-title|title=US Open finalist Anisimova beats Noskova to win Beijing title|date=5 October 2025 |publisher=France 24|accessdate=5 October 2025}}</ref> but withdrew before the start of the tournament due to a wrist injury.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.wtatennis.com/news/4581969/jessica-pegula-defending-champion-amanda-anisimova-withdraw-from-china-open-with-injuries|title=Pegula, defending champion Anisimova pull out of China Open with injuries|publisher=Women's Tennis Association|accessdate=25 September 2026}}</ref>

